==Battleground==
*4 [[Doge]]s spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 10~23.33 seconds<sup>300f~700f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge]]s spawn after 9.33 seconds<sup>280f</sup>, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Hippoe]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
**4 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

